  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORE FUNDING TO MISEAN CARA, WHICH PROVIDES GRANTS TO MISSIONARY ORGANISATIONS FOR THEIR DEVELOPMENT WORK IN AFRICA, ASIA AND SOUTH AMERICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER: The Redemptorists PROJECT: The main aim of the project by the Mavambo Trust is to improve access to formal education, and retention in formal education, for OVC. For Mavambo Trust, access to education is one of the key pillars for improved lives of OVC. The project will provide an education catch-up programme for 144 OVC over 3 years, who will then be supported to enrol in formal school. Mavambo will also support up to 400 former graduates and other OVC to ensure that they remain in school.</narrative>
  </description>
